    {
      "name": "PVTERR(MSG)",
      "reason": "'MSG' is assigned in the body but is declared 'character*(*)': f2py can only return a CHARACTER whose length is fixed in the declaration. An assumed-length output builds and then silently returns an empty string \u2014 measured, not assumed. Give it a length (CHARACTER*80) and it becomes an output."
    }
